# From init container: snapshot-finalizer-wait-for-seaweedfs-bucket - parent service: snapshot-finalizer - S3 secret key. Compose defaults to a local development credential; Kubernetes requires the referenced Secret. - (SECRET)
# From init container: snapshot-slice-consumer-wait-for-seaweedfs-bucket - parent service: snapshot-slice-consumer - S3 secret key. Compose defaults to a local development credential; Kubernetes requires the referenced Secret. - (SECRET)
